# Shop Page, Product Details & Shopping Cart

Build the customer-facing shop page, product detail page, and shopping cart, including all required database tables, models, controllers, views, and routes.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer

#### [NEW] `database/migrations/xxxx_create_products_table.php`
Products table with columns: `id`, `name`, `slug`, `short_description`, `description`, `regular_price`, `sale_price` (nullable), `SKU`, `stock_status` (enum: instock/outofstock), `featured` (boolean), `quantity`, `image` (main image), `images` (gallery, comma-separated filenames), `category_id` (FK → categories), `timestamps`.

#### [NEW] `database/migrations/xxxx_create_carts_table.php`
Session-based carts: `id`, `user_id` (nullable FK → users), `session_id` (for guest users), `timestamps`.

#### [NEW] `database/migrations/xxxx_create_cart_items_table.php`
Cart line items: `id`, `cart_id` (FK → carts), `product_id` (FK → products), `quantity`, `price`, `timestamps`.

