### Routes

#### [MODIFY] [routes/web.php](file:///c:/Users/Jorge/abacart_ph/routes/web.php)
Add public routes (no auth required):
```
GET  /shop                    → ShopController@index       (shop.index)
GET  /shop/product/{slug}     → ShopController@details     (shop.product.details)
GET  /cart                    → CartController@index        (cart.index)
POST /cart/add                → CartController@add_to_cart  (cart.add)
PUT  /cart/update             → CartController@update_cart  (cart.update)
DELETE /cart/remove/{id}      → CartController@remove_item  (cart.remove)
```

