## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Run `php artisan migrate` — verify the 3 new tables are created without errors
2. Seed a few products via tinker or admin panel, then visit `/shop` — products should display in a grid with pagination
3. Click a product → `/shop/product/{slug}` should show product details
4. Click "Add to Cart" → product should be added, cart count should update
5. Visit `/cart` → cart items should display with correct prices
6. Update quantity and remove items → cart should update accordingly
7. Verify nav links (Shop, Cart) work correctly from all pages
